{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_08_technical_debt_and_improvements_p0_defects", "label": "P0 Defects Backlog", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/08_TECHNICAL_DEBT_AND_IMPROVEMENTS.md", "source_location": "docs/08_TECHNICAL_DEBT_AND_IMPROVEMENTS.md:11-69", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "P0 is defined as breaking a user-visible path or producing incorrect output; the six P0 items are SourceType import, OCR fitz bug, preference injection, ignored PDF engine setting, fabricated references, and evaluator fail-open."}, {"id": "docs_08_technical_debt_and_improvements_preferences_injection", "label": "Persisted Preferences Never Injected into Workflow", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/08_TECHNICAL_DEBT_AND_IMPROVEMENTS.md", "source_location": "docs/08_TECHNICAL_DEBT_AND_IMPROVEMENTS.md:28-43", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Described as the single highest-impact product defect: the generator reads normalized.metadata['student_profile'] but nothing writes it, so saved Settings/Profile values never reach the front page."}, {"id": "docs_08_technical_debt_and_improvements_fabricated_references", "label": "Fabricated Default References", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/08_TECHNICAL_DEBT_AND_IMPROVEMENTS.md", "source_location": "docs/08_TECHNICAL_DEBT_AND_IMPROVEMENTS.md:54-60", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Two invented citations are inserted whenever none are supplied. Treated as an academic-integrity and trust problem rather than cosmetic, because the evaluator never checks reference authenticity; fix is to fail or emit [[MISSING: references]]."}, {"id": "docs_08_technical_debt_and_improvements_evaluator_fail_open", "label": "Evaluator Fails Open", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/08_TECHNICAL_DEBT_AND_IMPROVEMENTS.md", "source_location": "docs/08_TECHNICA